<!-- FAQ -->
<div class="faq" id="faq">
  <h3 class="faq-title rv" data-i18n="faq.title">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h3>
  <div class="faq-list" id="faqList">
    <details class="faq-item rv">
      <summary><span data-i18n="faq.q1">WHEN DOES MY ORDER ARRIVE?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
      <p data-i18n="faq.a1">We prepare within 24 h and deliver in 48–72 working hours. You'll get tracking by email as soon as it leaves the burrow.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item rv" data-delay="60">
      <summary><span data-i18n="faq.q2">HOW BIG ARE THE TOWEL AND THE PLUSH?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
      <p data-i18n="faq.a2">THE ZOOMIES towel is 100×50 cm, classic gym size, and comes in white, pink and black. The plush is desk-sized (~20 cm): it fits between your keyboard and your can without getting in the way.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item rv" data-delay="120">
      <summary><span data-i18n="faq.q3">CAN I RETURN SOMETHING?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
      <p data-i18n="faq.a3">Yes: 30 days for unused apparel and plush with tags on. Rabbit Fuel can't be returned once the pack is opened (for obvious reasons).</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item rv" data-delay="180">
      <summary><span data-i18n="faq.q4">WHAT EXACTLY IS IN RABBIT FUEL?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
      <p data-i18n="faq.a4">Carbonated water, yerba mate extract, guaraná extract, B vitamins and electrolytes. Zero sugar, zero taurine, vegan. 90 kcal per can.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item rv" data-delay="240">
      <summary><span data-i18n="faq.q5">IS THE PLUSH OFFICIAL?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
      <p data-i18n="faq.a5">Yes. It's based on the official Rabbit Fuel pixel logo, with high-quality embroidery and the official tag. Available in white and black.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item rv" data-delay="300">
      <summary><span data-i18n="faq.q6">WILL THERE BE A DROP 002?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
      <p data-i18n="faq.a6">Yes, but we won't say when. Join The Burrow and you'll know before anyone else.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</div>
